{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1738","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Palindrome Addicts"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to maintain a "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Queue_(abstract_data_type)"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"queue"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting of lowercase English letters as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"push"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$c$$$\": insert a letter $$$c$$$ at the back of the queue; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pop"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": delete a letter from the front of the queue. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially, the queue is empty. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each operation, you are asked to count the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"distinct"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" palindromic substrings in the string that are obtained by concatenating the letters from the front to the back of the queue."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Especially, the number of distinct palindromic substrings of the empty string is $$$0$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$s[1..n]$$$ of length $$$n$$$ is palindromic if $$$s[i] = s[n-i+1]$$$ for every $$$1 \\leq i \\leq n$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The string $$$s[l..r]$$$ is a substring of string $$$s[1..n]$$$ for every $$$1 \\leq l \\leq r \\leq n$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Two strings $$$s[1..n]$$$ and $$$t[1..m]$$$ are distinct, if at least one of the following holds. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$n \\neq m$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$s[i] \\neq t[i]$$$ for some $$$1 \\leq i \\leq \\min\\{n,m\\}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line is an integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\leq q \\leq 10^6$$$), indicating the number of operations."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$q$$$ lines follow. Each of the following lines contains one of the operations as follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"push"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$c$$$\": insert a letter $$$c$$$ at the back of the queue, where $$$c$$$ is a lowercase English letter; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pop"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\": delete a letter from the front of the queue. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that no \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"pop"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" operation will be performed when the queue is empty."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After each operation, print the number of distinct palindromic substrings in the string presented in the queue. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\npush a\npop\npush a\npush a\npush b\npush b\npush a\npush a\npop\npop\npop\npush b\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n6\n5\n4\n3\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$s_k$$$ be the string presented in the queue after the $$$k$$$-th operation, and let $$$c_k$$$ be the number of distinct palindromic substrings of $$$s_k$$$. The following table shows the details of the example."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$k$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$s_k$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$c_k$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$a$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text"